@startuml UC5_VisualizeSessionLog_RASD
autonumber
title [UC5] Visualize a session in the personal sessions log

' =======================================================
' ACTORS & SYSTEM
' =======================================================
actor "Registered User" as RU
participant "BBP system" as System

' =======================================================
' ENTRY CONDITION
' =======================================================
note over RU, System: Entry Condition: RU selects "My recorded trips"

' =======================================================
' (a) SYSTEM SHOWS THE SESSIONS LOG
' =======================================================
RU -> System: clickMyRecordedTrips()

' Internal Action
System -> System: retrieveSessionLog()
System --> RU: displaySessionLog(list_of_record)

' =======================================================
' (b) RU FINDS AND SELECTS THE SESSION
' =======================================================
RU -> System: selectSession(recordID)

' =======================================================
' (c) THE SYSTEM SHOWS THE DETAILS
' =======================================================
' Internal Action
System -> System: fetchSessionDetails(recordID)
System --> RU: displaySessionDetails(map, metrics)

' =======================================================
' EXIT CONDITION
' =======================================================
RU -> System: pressExit()
System --> RU: returnToMenu()

note over RU, System: Exit Condition: RU closes the log page

@enduml